	(text "MANDATORY: disconnect all loads and adjust U4 to 5.0 V before plugging C_BUCK_OUT.\nThe FCOB branch uses +12V_PROT directly; logic and analog boards use +5V_PROT.\nC_BUCK_IN and C_BUCK_OUT are separate keyed 2-way harnesses; never interchange them."
